---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { internalUrl } from '../utils/url';
---

<BaseLayout title="Now" description="What Aditya is focused on now.">
  <article class="standalone prose">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Now</p>
      <h1>What has my attention.</h1>
      <p>Last updated 27 July 2026.</p>
    </header>
    <p>This is a living note about the things I am actively doing and learning. It is intentionally shorter than a biography and more current than a résumé.</p>
    <h2>Making</h2>
    <p>I am improving this little publishing system and writing more often in public. The aim is not volume; it is a clearer archive of work that may help someone later.</p>
    <h2>Learning</h2>
    <p>I am returning to the fundamentals: clear writing, dependable frontend systems, and the patient craft of reducing complexity without reducing care.</p>
    <h2>Reading</h2>
    <p>I am reading slowly and keeping fewer, better notes. The <a href={internalUrl('/books/')}>books page</a> is where I keep the ones that continue to be useful.</p>
    <p><em>This page is inspired by <a href="https://nownownow.com/about">Derek Sivers’ now-page idea</a>.</em></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
